# Language-stats tuning for GitHub Linguist.
#
# The core of this project is the Rust judge/server in `server/`. The following
# paths are development/asset tooling and procedurally-generated rendering code,
# not the primary application, so they are excluded from the repository language
# breakdown (they still build and ship normally).

# Auxiliary dev/build tooling: Blender model generators and helper scripts.
tools/**            linguist-vendored

# Procedural 3D character/ring engine rendered at runtime from Three.js
# primitives (ported from the Blender asset pipeline).
leaderboard/src/three/**  linguist-vendored

# Generated lockfiles.
leaderboard/package-lock.json  linguist-generated
